    {
      "fragment_type": "behavioral_spec",
      "content": "The residual risk level column (NH) for all evaluated risks in sections 3.1 and 3.2 is marked 'N', indicating all residual risks are acceptable after control measures are applied. Post-mitigation probability for all risks in section 3.1 is reduced to 1 (except R19 which remains at 2), and severity values are unchanged from initial assessment.",
